# The Black Gate played with a Jaguar pad (platform/common/pad.c): walking with the pad, the
# pointer moved with A held and in Option's mode, C and B as the mouse buttons, and the keypad's
# hotkeys (1 inventory, * Esc).
# Start: the save bg-newgame.scr ends with. Arguments: --program u7 p ABCD<0xFF>
#@start bg-start
#@args --program u7 p ABCD\0377
13000 shot PAD0.PPM
13500 pad up
15500 pad none
16000 pad right+down
18000 pad none
18500 shot PAD1.PPM
# the pointer: a tap, then held
19000 pad a
19100 pad a+left
19200 pad a
19500 pad a+left+up
20500 pad a
20700 pad none
21000 shot PAD2.PPM
# Option: the pad moves the pointer, and A held walks
21500 pad option
21700 pad none
22000 pad down
22600 pad none
23000 pad a+left
24000 pad none
24500 shot PAD3.PPM
# C looks at what is under the pointer; keypad 1 opens the inventory and * closes it
25000 pad c
25150 pad none
26000 pad 1
26200 pad none
27500 shot PAD4.PPM
28000 pad star
28200 pad none
# back to walking; B held walks toward the pointer
28500 pad option
28700 pad none
29000 pad right
29100 pad none
29500 pad b
31000 pad none
31500 shot PAD5.PPM
32000 quit
